     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <br><br>This works for me:<br><br>My Highcharts plot takes a dataframe with the following format:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><pre><span style=\"color:#000\">                 </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Areas</span><span style=\"color:#000\">            </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Categories</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Listens</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Booked</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Services</span><span style=\"color:#000\">          </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Confirmation</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">9380</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Booked</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Services</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Flight</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Connections</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1557</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#000\">      </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Booked</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Services</span><span style=\"color:#000\">          </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Flight</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Fares</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#066\">827</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#06